{"id":"P039-2","subject":"P","unit":"P039","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P039-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n3000/300V의 단상 변압기 1차측 임피던스가 Ω,\n\n2차를 1차로 환산한 합성 임피던스가 Ω일 때,\n\n2차측의 임피던스Ω는?\n\n\n①        ② \n\n③       ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":587},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":968}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n전압의 순싯값이 cos°V이고, 주파수\n를 Hz, 최댓값을 V, 위상을 °라고 할 때,\n‘’를 계산한 값의 절댓값은?\n\n\n① 8           ② 38\n\n③ 68          ④ 98\n\n⑤ 128","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":644},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":622}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n정현파 전류의 실횻값이 A 일 때, 정현파 전류의\n\n평균값은 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n① 4           ② 8\n\n③ 16          ④ 24\n\n⑤ 32","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":902}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n비정현파 교류전압이\nsinsinV로 표현되고,\n실횻값이 18V일 때, 의 값은 얼마인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":592},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":359}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n3상 유도전동기에 250V를 인가하여 기동할 때, 기동토\n\n크가 N⦁m였다. 이 전동기에 300V를 인가하는 경\n\n우에 기동토크N⦁m는 어떻게 되는가?\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③         ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1257}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n3상 불평형 전압에서 역상전압이 50V, 정상전압이\n\n250V, 영상전압이 25V라고 할 때, 전압의 불평형률은\n\n몇 인가?\n\n\n① 10          ② 15\n\n③ 20          ④ 25\n\n⑤ 30","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":625}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n동기발전기의 병렬운전 조건으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 기전력의 크기가 같아야 한다.\n\n② 기전력의 위상이 같아야 한다.\n\n③ 병렬운전하는 발전기의 용량은 같지 않아도 된다.\n\n④ 상회전 방향은 임의로 하여도 관계없다.\n\n⑤ 기전력의 파형이 같아야 한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1191}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n3상 권선형 유도전동기의 기동법에 해당되는 것은?\n\n\n① 전전압 기동법     ② Y-△ 기동법\n\n③ 기동보상기법     ④ 리액터 기동법\n\n⑤ 2차 저항 기동법","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":515},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":691}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n3상 전원에 △결선으로 접속된 커패시터의 진상용량이\n\n30kVA이다. 이것을 Y결선으로 바꾸었을 때, 진상용량\n\n은 몇 kVA인가?\n\n①           ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":732},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1560}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanati